imagePullSecrets: Listing<Dynamic>?

/// Global container registry override for tool images (e.g., wait4x, kubectl). When set, this registry
/// is prepended to tool image repositories for compatibility with CRI-O v1.34+ which enforces fully
/// qualified image names. If left empty, defaults to "docker.io".
imageRegistry: String?

ingress: Ingress?

